{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012gSWbz2qe6CpXSncgnfcQ2","type":"tool_result","content":"223:- `new E.View(id, label, yaw, pitch, scale = 1, zBoost = 1) → view`: new E.View(id, label, yaw, pitch, scale, zBoost): an orthographic camera (degrees; scale = screen pixels per world unit; zBoost stretches heights)\n228:- `view.set(yaw, pitch, scale = 1, zBoost = 1)`: change the angles and scale in place (game.setView and rotateView use their own copies); returns the view\n231:- `view.bx`, `view.by`, `view.bz`: screen y = bx * x + by * y + bz * z (the second row; bz < 0 lifts things up the screen)\n243:- `view.zBoost`: how much heights are stretched on screen (1 = true)\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174819__xcfe199/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"708825b7-ef23-4499-af9e-674001e2db5c","uuid":"3f51bedd-a174-4b01-a9b5-e7a9bd3c174e","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:02:38.173Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"223:- `new E.View(id, label, yaw, pitch, scale = 1, zBoost = 1) → view`: new E.View(id, label, yaw, pitch, scale, zBoost): an orthographic camera (degrees; scale = screen pixels per world unit; zBoost stretches heights)\n228:- `view.set(yaw, pitch, scale = 1, zBoost = 1)`: change the angles and scale in place (game.setView and rotateView use their own copies); returns the view\n231:- `view.bx`, `view.by`, `view.bz`: screen y = bx * x + by * y + bz * z (the second row; bz < 0 lifts things up the screen)\n243:- `view.zBoost`: how much heights are stretched on screen (1 = true)","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174819__xcfe199/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_012gSWbz2qe6CpXSncgnfcQ2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
