{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh2eTUMREq34HPqLZ93g","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The walls sit 110 U from home, so the backstop becomes an arc of radius 110 joining them, with the dugouts set into the foul walls and the on-deck circles moved to (∓78, −21). I'm patching §5 and §4.2 with that.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5929,"cache_read_input_tokens":428940,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5929},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"708825b7-ef23-4499-af9e-674001e2db5c","uuid":"16bebe0f-4bb3-43ab-96b7-79726c280e76","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:35:59.100Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh2eTDUp9KEs6YVTpW3d","narration_block_indexes":[0],"thinking_duration_ms":1,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh2eTUMREq34HPqLZ93g","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GvuDrjf5Y3uDaWBVKGeLti","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport pathlib\np = pathlib.Path('PLAN.md'); s = p.read_text()\nfixes = [\n (\"| on-deck circles | (−150, +60) and (+150, +60) |\\n| dugouts | 3B side x −380..−250, y +20..+56; 1B side mirrored (cut-down walls with benches) |\",\n  \"| on-deck circles | 40 U outside each foul line, 70 U from H along it: about (−78, −21) and (+78, −21) |\\n| dugouts | set into each foul wall, from 110 to 230 U along the line from H, 30 U deep, with benches and a low roof (cut-down walls) |\"),\n (\"Foul poles stand at θ = ±45°, 150 U tall. **Foul walls** (the stands' front) run parallel to the foul lines, 70 U\\noutside them, from the backstop to the poles. The **backstop** is the line y = +96 from x −150 to +150, joined to the\\nfoul walls by 45° segments.\",\n  \"Foul poles stand at θ = ±45°, 150 U tall. **Foul walls** (the stands' front) run parallel to the foul lines, 70 U\\noutside them, from each pole in toward home until they are 110 U from H (at about (−110, −10) and (+110, −10)). The\\n**backstop** is the arc r = 110 around H that joins them behind the plate (it passes (0, +110)). Check any new\\ncoordinate against this outline: everything on the field must be inside it.\"),\n (\"| Type | Use | Settings |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `F` | the fence | h = Hf, padded material per park, `roof: 'plain'` in the park's top-line color |\\n| `S1`–`S4` | stand tiers | h 52 / 64 / 76 / 88; face `'stone'`, `'plank'` or a park material |\",\n  \"Legend characters map to numeric wall type ids (`types: { 1: {...} }`), as in the sports kit:\\n\\n| Legend char | Use | Settings |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `F` | the fence | h = Hf, padded material per park, `roof: 'plain'` in the park's top-line color |\\n| `1`–`4` | stand tiers, front to back | h 52 / 64 / 76 / 88; face `'stone'`, `'plank'` or a park material |\"),\n (\"| `34-menus.js` | title, mode select, team select and joining,\",\n  \"| `34-menus.js` | title (with its mode menu), team select and joining,\"),\n]\nfor old, new in fixes:\n    n = s.count(old); assert n == 1, (n, old[:60])\n    s = s.replace(old, new)\np.write_text(s); print('ok')\nPY\ngrep -n \"dugout\" PLAN.md | cut -c1-200 | head","description":"Fix the foul walls, backstop, dugouts and on-deck circles"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5929,"cache_read_input_tokens":428940,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5929},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"708825b7-ef23-4499-af9e-674001e2db5c","uuid":"fc1f7bf3-04de-4a86-a600-b02cb531afc6","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:36:06.065Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh2eTDUp9KEs6YVTpW3d","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01GvuDrjf5Y3uDaWBVKGeLti":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174819__xcfe199/work && python3 - <<'PY'\nimport pathlib\np = pathlib.Path('PLAN.md'); s = p.read_text()\nfixes = [\n (\"| on-deck circles | (−150, +60) and (+150, +60) |\\n| dugouts | 3B side x −380..−250, y +20..+56; 1B side mirrored (cut-down walls with benches) |\",\n  \"| on-deck circles | 40 U outside each foul line, 70 U from H along it: about (−78, −21) and (+78, −21) |\\n| dugouts | set into each foul wall, from 110 to 230 U along the line from H, 30 U deep, with benches and a low roof (cut-down walls) |\"),\n (\"Foul poles stand at θ = ±45°, 150 U tall. **Foul walls** (the stands' front) run parallel to the foul lines, 70 U\\noutside them, from the backstop to the poles. The **backstop** is the line y = +96 from x −150 to +150, joined to the\\nfoul walls by 45° segments.\",\n  \"Foul poles stand at θ = ±45°, 150 U tall. **Foul walls** (the stands' front) run parallel to the foul lines, 70 U\\noutside them, from each pole in toward home until they are 110 U from H (at about (−110, −10) and (+110, −10)). The\\n**backstop** is the arc r = 110 around H that joins them behind the plate (it passes (0, +110)). Check any new\\ncoordinate against this outline: everything on the field must be inside it.\"),\n (\"| Type | Use | Settings |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `F` | the fence | h = Hf, padded material per park, `roof: 'plain'` in the park's top-line color |\\n| `S1`–`S4` | stand tiers | h 52 / 64 / 76 / 88; face `'stone'`, `'plank'` or a park material |\",\n  \"Legend characters map to numeric wall type ids (`types: { 1: {...} }`), as in the sports kit:\\n\\n| Legend char | Use | Settings |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `F` | the fence | h = Hf, padded material per park, `roof: 'plain'` in the park's top-line color |\\n| `1`–`4` | stand tiers, front to back | h 52 / 64 / 76 / 88; face `'stone'`, `'plank'` or a park material |\"),\n (\"| `34-menus.js` | title, mode select, team select and joining,\",\n  \"| `34-menus.js` | title (with its mode menu), team select and joining,\"),\n]\nfor old, new in fixes:\n    n = s.count(old); assert n == 1, (n, old[:60])\n    s = s.replace(old, new)\np.write_text(s); print('ok')\nPY\ngrep -n \"dugout\" PLAN.md | cut -c1-200 | head","description":"Fix the foul walls, backstop, dugouts and on-deck circles"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01GvuDrjf5Y3uDaWBVKGeLti":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174819__xcfe199/work"}}}
