{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh2sWy4MASYxSGTPDRaW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VYohL5A5P6k2P2cNnKx5e2","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport pathlib\np = pathlib.Path('PLAN.md'); s = p.read_text()\nfixes = [\n (\"ARM and GLV (glove); pitchers have VEL (velocity), CTL (control), BRK (break) and STA (stamina). Stat 5 is the ×1.0\\nbaseline: a stat's factor is `1 + 0.03 · (stat − 5)` (0.88–1.15), unless a formula says otherwise. B/T is the side they bat / throw from.\",\n  \"ARM and GLV (glove); pitchers have VEL (velocity), CTL (control), BRK (break) and STA (stamina). Stat 5 is the ×1.0\\nbaseline: a stat's factor is `1 + 0.03 · (stat − 5)` (0.88–1.15), unless a formula says otherwise. B/T is the side\\nthey bat / throw from.\"),\n (\"- **Mortimer Megamax:** the villain, owner of MegaMax Corp. `outfit: 'coat'`, `hat: 'tophat'` (§3.3), a gold watch chain; voice saw at 140 Hz. He watches from a luxury box in the MegaDome.\",\n  \"- **Mortimer Megamax:** the villain, owner of MegaMax Corp. `outfit: 'coat'`, `hat: 'tophat'` (§3.3), a gold watch\\n  chain; voice saw at 140 Hz. He watches from a luxury box in the MegaDome.\"),\n (\"d > 1.6 r. Otherwise:\\n\",\n  \"d > 1.6 r. The timing grades are **PERFECT** within ±22 ms, **GOOD** within ±50 ms and **OK** within ±90 ms (all ×\\n`TUNE.swingTiming` × assist). Otherwise:\\n\"),\n]\nfor old, new in fixes:\n    n = s.count(old); assert n == 1, (n, old[:60])\n    s = s.replace(old, new)\np.write_text(s); print('ok')\nPY","description":"Re-wrap long lines and define the timing grades"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6621,"cache_read_input_tokens":483673,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6621},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"708825b7-ef23-4499-af9e-674001e2db5c","uuid":"60f410e9-4462-4d06-8d66-1ea46d21defe","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:38:26.222Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh2sWivramDo3peA8HTP","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01VYohL5A5P6k2P2cNnKx5e2":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174819__xcfe199/work && python3 - <<'PY'\nimport pathlib\np = pathlib.Path('PLAN.md'); s = p.read_text()\nfixes = [\n (\"ARM and GLV (glove); pitchers have VEL (velocity), CTL (control), BRK (break) and STA (stamina). Stat 5 is the ×1.0\\nbaseline: a stat's factor is `1 + 0.03 · (stat − 5)` (0.88–1.15), unless a formula says otherwise. B/T is the side they bat / throw from.\",\n  \"ARM and GLV (glove); pitchers have VEL (velocity), CTL (control), BRK (break) and STA (stamina). Stat 5 is the ×1.0\\nbaseline: a stat's factor is `1 + 0.03 · (stat − 5)` (0.88–1.15), unless a formula says otherwise. B/T is the side\\nthey bat / throw from.\"),\n (\"- **Mortimer Megamax:** the villain, owner of MegaMax Corp. `outfit: 'coat'`, `hat: 'tophat'` (§3.3), a gold watch chain; voice saw at 140 Hz. He watches from a luxury box in the MegaDome.\",\n  \"- **Mortimer Megamax:** the villain, owner of MegaMax Corp. `outfit: 'coat'`, `hat: 'tophat'` (§3.3), a gold watch\\n  chain; voice saw at 140 Hz. He watches from a luxury box in the MegaDome.\"),\n (\"d > 1.6 r. Otherwise:\\n\",\n  \"d > 1.6 r. The timing grades are **PERFECT** within ±22 ms, **GOOD** within ±50 ms and **OK** within ±90 ms (all ×\\n`TUNE.swingTiming` × assist). Otherwise:\\n\"),\n]\nfor old, new in fixes:\n    n = s.count(old); assert n == 1, (n, old[:60])\n    s = s.replace(old, new)\np.write_text(s); print('ok')\nPY","description":"Re-wrap long lines and define the timing grades"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01VYohL5A5P6k2P2cNnKx5e2":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/run