{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh2y2VxQVJe3tq2eQRLq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EtC5FkErN4NAAjsUqqh86K","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport pathlib\np = pathlib.Path('PLAN.md'); s = p.read_text()\nfixes = [\n (\"- **Input through contexts.** Modules ask the context router (§6.14), never raw keys.\",\n  \"- **Rigs are cosmetic.** Gameplay never reads rig joints: the ball's release and contact points come from fixed\\n  offsets per player and job (the gallery checks that they match the drawn hand and bat). So headless sims, tests and\\n  the playthrough can skip `rig.update` (`BZ.cosmetic = false`), which keeps thousands of simulated innings fast.\\n- **Input through contexts.** Modules ask the context router (§6.14), never raw keys.\"),\n (\"One test, run by the bot through the real inputs, with no errors allowed anywhere (`game.errors` empty at every\\nstep) and a time limit of 180 s of real time:\",\n  \"One test, run by the bot through the real inputs with `BZ.cosmetic = false`, with no errors allowed anywhere\\n(`game.errors` empty at every step) and a real-time limit (measure the run once, then fix the limit at about 1.5× that,\\nand at most 5 minutes):\"),\n]\nfor old, new in fixes:\n    n = s.count(old); assert n == 1, (n, old[:60])\n    s = s.replace(old, new)\np.write_text(s); print('ok')\nPY","description":"Make rigs cosmetic for fast headless runs"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4339,"cache_read_input_tokens":509979,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4339},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"708825b7-ef23-4499